      "operation": "add",
      "after": "<h1>室内地图</h1><div><img src=\"assets/b011b73afad66392f7464cb12150b82af0875c57691b91390ec98e7e53b3c05a.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div><h1>循环开始</h1><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/44aae81417d0583507ed5e26c017319d7f73ede75753e57c7751a87e06f369a1.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>MIRANDA的书：《STARDUST》</b></div></div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/5914633dab42864762c9ff7b76f08379aef50310bda14d16aee39a8f5dfcc4cb.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width: 80%; display: block; border-radius: 4px; margin: 8px auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span><b>线索在MIRANDA电脑</b></span><br></div></div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/b6cb51d0d36c0488e82b66468ba84b868dd98ffb84d915ea3e304fb34ae0bf84.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>密码随机</b></div></div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/835b3564aaf9d0011708803c3447553a1b8b2bc7fa05dbec4b7d78cec92ba929.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>保险库密码输入方式</b></div></div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/cdafeefa14e4e8a2de9c88535fd4da2196158f5382c711e99278694bdd6c2e46.webp\" alt=\"\" style=\"width: 80%; display: block; border-radius: 4px; margin: 8px auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>密码：先输入/000/，然后22/06/2435（随机）</b></div></div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/9ca2d67a20211cb601b69cbf7dc0bdb874d5d8d924d3a76f5eceea1af7b87cc0.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>MIRANDA的门禁卡</b></div></div><h1>关卡01 首次进入厨房</h1><div><img src=\"assets/28ce240f5f98c9e5bd78e5da07c598bd59047ca0fa147174b961a8f6e9b044e7.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div><img src=\"assets/41073df638eb4fede1a164ca47b00d9e4eb3e7fb1ce02a0189ecfa2aab6fec95.webp\" style=\"width: 80%; display: block; border-radius: 4px; margin: 8px auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/850b91222a20abab209303c1a16ead85a05a382c27a3b78af4758c792a4c910b.webp\" style=\"width: 80%; display: block; border-radius: 4px; margin: 8px auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\">对接口PIN密码<br></div></div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/13dd333fc526c4fdd91b54d7fe6a7be41d246aff329ff32bcef1bba9b0a3aa15.webp\" style=\"width: 80%; display: block; border-radius: 4px; margin: 8px auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\">先不要点停靠系统</div></div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/0706cc44f887bccae343e43ab6b95a4c650ffe79d15e193c7e424c123b77e57e.webp\" style=\"width: 80%; display: block; border-radius: 4px; margin: 8px auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\">先在1楼休息室区域拿电池1，然后去机器人区域</div></div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/6585b20b9d65290dbccbda086799a40a8cdec8ab58c49958295891e8cd84e1f7.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\">机器人区域，插入电池1、电池2<br></div></div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/23956ce15be52e2c48d2898049e038a3fcd525b8c390a1152f30f2d434218349.webp\" style=\"width: 80%; display: block; border-radius: 4px; margin: 8px auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\">去培育区，拿电池3，再返回机器人区域，插入电池3</div></div><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/0631d191c93c1b6c5fce4ede4792a2b710fc3c8317af9e36bbcf6e6d929e46df.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>打开药箱，获取船舱通行权限</span></div></div></div><div><h2 style=\"text-align: left;\">首次进入舱段</h2></div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/b08b7fc6495b6b55bd76e0cdce1f8af8a3d95171492e555a3b8887a331b43073.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\">前往舱段</div></div><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/1d37c0ec4785c1f7c79c4ebdd34871094cf7011045a0c9c9f59b3579ecccbda8.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\">右拐找到玩家储物罐，找到钥匙</div></div></div><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/b3001c0a01f4202cb5a5ec68bcc2e77e6cce8e3ec64580e1caac321ef66c0438.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\">停靠系统培育区，调整钥匙打开箱子，获取关卡02门禁卡（残缺）</div></div></div><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/87d9d9dfea1a809fa0f6f019062b430642e7d17117fb6e4439e3ca2155f67059.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\">标识符：2621967</div></div></div><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/f83d08b6dab1848272524aef6ebb430ef26d77c2ecbf3296948c67129adcba9c.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\">部分条码及数字，残缺的可以根据玩家的门禁卡补充</div></div></div><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/101dd49c57af870f828187ca793ee719a09c55bb692bbb34e0f2223609d3bd35.webp\" style=\"width: 80%; display: block; border-radius: 4px; margin: 8px auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\">前往舱段门禁卡制作器，制作关卡02门禁卡</div></div><h1>关卡02 首次进入大厅</h1><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/4663ce8e3f4018ed0bd96ec8fd6e519761ad58359d4e912645897d0cf80e7a34.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\">前往大厅<br></div></div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/96751f8760cbeae00a7ee2274db844d01bbaff232f02a0b405a32a99b2ae8b7a.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\">电箱谜题：每个引脚颜色对应一次加减，合计为+12即可解锁音频【拼图】</div></div></div><div></div><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/68ce51dcb71239baad3b2848d7c4c56906a987759630e0e6c25160a1544157a8.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\">【视界探测器】音频听取到Igor</div></div></div><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/62e80a604ff6be00fc8e5321563c82b0ca41b5a3a339a681c669e4aee18d3f7e.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\">在黄圈内播放【拼图】音频，听取到Petrov</div></div><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/b388202cd79e4009ee5e04aa6529aff0a144672fd7c246fa83fe47e9453e05f8.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\">大厅电脑：Igor Petrov</div></div><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/dd756f59b35b18918b363bf0f2c48c8b9724a8e3432eaf86aa7a980c2a6d77ba.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\">更新K9，升级无接触门禁系统（解锁储物柜、连接器等）</div></div><h3><span>依次前往舱段打开AMAAN储物柜（获取今年生日日期）、厨房冰箱蛋糕蜡烛（获取年龄）、AMAAN房间（打开AMAAN保险库）</span></h3><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/d65a4e19b0000113e5e9ac51ce5d9ab6d2f8020de8948bd3952be05b4d8e960c.webp\" style=\"width: 80%; display: block; border-radius: 4px; margin: 8px auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\">今年生日日期：25/08/2466</div></div></div><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/f4f442e89619d0ccf183c07fd9e9121eb869b5c29f21066dc856ed8eecfad111.webp\" style=\"width: 80%; display: block; border-radius: 4px; margin: 8px auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\">60岁生日</div></div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/7c70a156215d089c236302e42565274a856fe47c2d0db713dedc04c01175e696.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\">AMAAN生日：25/08/2406</div></div></div><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/133169bdc8d7b7e6c5aeb649def8a9f60a969df0345bc2584d56e66bf821692b.webp\" style=\"width: 80%; display: block; border-radius: 4px; margin: 8px auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\">AMAAN保险库饮料：COSMIK!</div></div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/b232d07f5d5f4ebed52b8aa19a9cde5f0e534b8583d9b88ef4e8b97ca598ddde.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>根据AMAAN卧室3张语法说明，依次输入</span></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\">LS</div><div style=\"text-align: center;\">BUILD HYPERVIOLET.QB</div><div style=\"text-align: center;\">COPY FLASHLIGHT.EXE MIRANDA.V<br></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\">获取紫外光</div></div></div><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/f0e8a27a1c5b98c71514df52a3cfb6c84bcdda41f3d2a8b66ce88a11c9dabe8e.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\">紫外照射</div></div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/85333699669f8ceeecd7eafe4aa03b80ba26302f69adbd5a94cd160c1fd151bc.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\">AMAAN保险库</div></div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/221392bfb15d45bf69f5df2fcdf989e65f6c72d8f4baec6747403eb4719d0896.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\">厨房零食贩卖机</div></div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/c02849d3f5f473021783f1bcccc51dd14aac9e0adc120e466f5d6545ffbe776a.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\">AMAAN房间白板，紫外照射<br></div></div><div><img src=\"assets/d3d327411ba049a27f154a678b9c97010d25c2bf9510ae7c550ade414bb01921.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/a92bdd71df4182b4bfe819623fcb13d43a9a1d0f040f988648756456f9c513d0.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\">从自动贩卖机获取【多重通行权】门禁卡</div></div></div></div></div><h2>首次进入车库</h2><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/01f95023c620c86a83fa37d707f45d0597d263947278c4b27c9556a9bf490085.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/b68fc4d05158cc76288af1172bcf53280bdd30be1de36b76a80e83daa9a8dcc2.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\">1楼3个，2楼1个，全部插入船体并关闭，上2楼</div></div><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/3a87a26d142cd5638fa834d514927f69e071c7b6e07694238be1924c9654ae80.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><div><span style=\"text-align: center\"><b>1.</b>ARES—SCRP-01—SCRP-02—AST-AR1—SDT-11—X-248—LUX-8—BTH-12—DATA-04</span><br></div><div><span style=\"text-align: center\"><b>2.</b>DATA-04—NNS-7—RE-005—VAN-26—ARK-18—X-303—Y-1KFT—Z-4MK—TIE-1—DATA-01</span><span style=\"text-align: center\"><br></span></div><div><span><b>3.</b>DATA-01—ORB-2—OA-9—AQ-94—GW-11—AW-13—SHFT-1—DATA-06—ATV-3—SA-X—MVL-30—ORE-X—VR-M—DATA-03</span><span style=\"text-align: center\"><br></span></div><div><span><b>4.</b>DATA-03—12B-0—P88-1—SPKT—ESA-6—DATA-02—CXO-X—11K-68—XM-R—EK-TE—ZX-2A—DATA-05</span><span><br></span></div><div><span><b>5.</b>DATA-05—SAS-11—EOS—MER-A—AUOS—RD-004—ARES</span></div></div></div><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/eb2fd366f8dc0ad5e560787bfcaac94c2c87a0d6f94d4df096633e468a6f5ec8.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/514c2df824eb3f7e500b3bca46bd7d2990a19fd4bd12c029f398312fa2faf18b.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>车库1楼电脑桌右侧，拿着【输入板】到大厅的视界探测器，根据粒子波音频，</span></div><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>在输入板上还原出6位数字顺序（随机），顺序播放音频给视界探测器</span><br></div></div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/ea1423845b021fcc070422edfad2b38fdfe8bb6b6fe093d6857728c31d1aa24d.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\">完成后，获取车库二楼电脑的EXNILON方案，前往使用</div></div><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/4ed433a4f8edbddd25c913d0c726359ee3a1289a005921f02a874035197fca67.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\">解锁车库二楼电脑，获取量子电池容器密码<br></div></div><h2><b>首次前往连接器的实验室（左岔路）</b></h2></div></div></div></div><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/843003fc9b7e83bffe0eb4aba5550dc2d9f4b3b07a05c032e715564f2de9602f.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\">实验室密码提示：AION属于什么纲（之后获取）</div></div><h2>首次前往连接器的观测站（右岔路）</h2></div><div><img src=\"assets/837b8487108e64cb6c0a7feaf4516dcc1d50ebd319de456755071e64ad70c76d.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div><div><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/dd1cf32b9bfd62dd73230901ca0889125341b8d33d1d8360a1f297b6ba19c854.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Planta中心密码，AMAAN的可托（德）西林药物处方<br></div></div></div><div><img src=\"assets/c22991803ff55a27ad63398aa2684f10d1a7dd3e3526c2b9d06daed7d58c6f43.webp\" style=\"width: 80%; display: block; border-radius: 4px; margin: 8px auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/3f374eccd9c31cddd2dc0094a0c0673594b354bf6c43865bc688ef32d032337a.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div><img src=\"assets/3e6e930645e0aee417e8d2d5345a8c98c4180303f42bf3e5112596cf84e3f38c.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><img src=\"assets/6a2751ad2c3fb350357f3a7b10b3ec9374f48f5e7228493dddef032360357f10.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><img src=\"assets/7de439537a6a4873a8ecd33dd21c7fa74c1611370fd40d9f88617326311154c8.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/942aef19c59c96e1c75311f4aa985abc7e6e53b5f536687588efc9dfae72235e.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\">用于合成可托（德）西林药片，在AMAAN房间浴室</div></div><img src=\"assets/c9e4c7de499ab1c5b49b1f9a476d5d7f4f6b6dcb20c94d2814f6d2566475fbb1.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/a0f39fca2df22f9146b2945ab148ac785f5800eecdc3be4c84aebbb5d3a8092d.webp\" style=\"width: 80%; display: block; border-radius: 4px; margin: 8px auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\">可托（德）药物提取于Mavors</div></div><img src=\"assets/1a1f23c49af39b2a4e88dfdc8444ca41cb66a61cfdac022971ed4befa64de025.webp\" style=\"width: 80%; display: block; border-radius: 4px; margin: 8px auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div></div><div><img src=\"assets/6ce47557319614bc52988a8ca3103a4802cd761e07515a738c7907b3a02ed09e.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><img src=\"assets/405c7ad8feece64ab0aca09a3b7508bdeb1942b37a771a756d921366223714a7.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><img src=\"assets/3404a684348129e0a7accb6c6099676b217065b73541767605c67c97e0be493d.webp\" style=\"width: 80%; display: block; border-radius: 4px; margin: 8px auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><h2>新一循环直奔连接器——实验室，提前插入量子电池（进入需要剩余2格电）</h2></div><div><img src=\"assets/61f5c8d1dc6ac58904ba5ed7a998e292cdd51f0d7fc00655e49e7c5e6f313029.webp\" style=\"width: 80%; display: block; border-radius: 4px; margin: 8px auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><h2>集齐4个JK指纹</h2></div><div><img src=\"assets/f08398bb22edfbbcbe7487e059eaff653a713fb3b9cf2d24c00974caf9c45d4d.webp\" style=\"width: 80%; display: block; border-radius: 4px; margin: 8px auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><img src=\"assets/a75c85b358bb1cb2381db50375e213b7e8af8e25ccd113c79e0fcb2bdc0c09c9.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><img src=\"assets/967bcef15cf025e5a54e481a8eaa1b257a463ff9ee3da23aa0589653f562eb87.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><img src=\"assets/5dde8c8b0e2f08893eecdd4c137048f29e15cf847978cf88599619efcdedd890.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><img src=\"assets/7861ab6a8b8964fd71fa8cd4b5270951470be5a9cb9341a336cdc444cba8f42d.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><img src=\"assets/ae980c91a124ae0f2e250358bc7786e7c9de93376bf15311c2faca07bfdde15f.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><img src=\"assets/f8fe2561390e10d41cc474acbb4871a32f145a7335d7d8f0df09330d7cb689fa.webp\" style=\"width: 80%; display: block; border-radius: 4px; margin: 8px auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/aa756bf99b60297ace50fa59fed360022f307843a58409c1963a85853387671a.webp\" style=\"width: 80%; display: block; border-radius: 4px; margin: 8px auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\">集齐JK指纹，用于观测站解锁太阳能板</div></div><h2>新一循环，不要使用量子电池，直奔连接器——<span style=\"text-align: center\">观测站</span></h2></div><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/3d1c2712db9d16e2066494ed5ebae69ab01941c4ab9be16ad5a98d99223eee8f.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\">插入量子电池，验证指纹</div></div><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/ef6b76c05e6c10412a884aa24f02162ac52e9b538ac23b278e09606c2b2354a5.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\">谜题随机，连接电路，使得电源达到+2</div></div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/5066c47a54091c154b7a0922d7a2c0b51524f06e2afc4d114f635a9d49280245.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\">获取关卡03门禁卡信息，打印方法（在MIRANDA储物柜拿钥匙，培育区箱子破碎门禁卡，去打印）</div></div><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/c3e003a0b6e0d21ada9014b88e6ea34319b914930251b11319d23cbe4a7cf05d.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\">关卡03门禁卡</div></div><div><h1>关卡03 获取列车通行证，乘坐列车</h1></div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/c33019da5cf966b19a9f22764ea1f2ff15ace55f66d836c4fc76815062404e71.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/8cdaddd51c1591ae2150a81791a5dd124b2d6661065eddc42b44143693b32773.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>JAHI储物柜获取列车通行证（用于车库2楼乘坐地铁）</span><br></div></div></div><h2>新一循环，拿上电池（不插电），前往舱段——车库（二楼）</h2></div></div></div><div><img src=\"assets/7cf0a4d0ad0cea611d27ed720b645d0e7263a0390b666ee58050de22b5d9ca84.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/41f633df9514a3ce82134d87cbf753d5c72e180840a4e890cceafc591f111812.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\">前往大厅（二楼）</div></div><div><img src=\"assets/ec9664731556dc8d7a5d39cff9b4ddf541fb51620040a71d5ae9282fa66412cd.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/22d35e918abca062ffe3f24f8a2c50a159d4102fcb87b5a12ad6cfc1436a9d58.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\">去列车取收容钥匙，列车前往实验室（二楼）</div></div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/db3e15cbbef8d5f0adbf4f6e8f461d9755fde55c20756500e7bfce51067996af.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\">右侧放下梯子前往实验室1楼（未断电）</div></div><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/c6265f0baa0ec0dd5768252584234e99b5b1f6bd97215d7d0ac4220f2917ed01.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\">容器谜题解法详情见章节《谜题》成就【开锁大师】</div></div><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/8a9e7e2b3f7737bedd80e120a45cfd7f1d8646e4b15c508d7f8b1900e8aa5def.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\">本循环结束记得把数据卡放在列车上，复制至下一循环</div></div><h2>回趟MIRANDA房间，大屏幕左侧无接触打开锁柜，解开颜色加减法谜题，解锁ARES赞助视频，得到赞助商信息，用于实验室1楼电脑密码</h2></div></div></div></div><div><img src=\"assets/e5631d4b663143774e847581afa7f7c5e4d6235c23df7f5779b6daf49d5fb25e.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><img src=\"assets/ab521fcd682821f914b8a6dfc8d03abe328e7f8197039c0d4f5930caf61f6935.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div><h2>新一循环，坐列车去大厅（二楼），插入数据卡</h2><div><img src=\"assets/98a5c0e634d3ef0d274aa3a16edfacc8031c8587dd9ef1b7b05cccbc3fc7650c.webp\" style=\"width: 80%; display: block; border-radius: 4px; margin: 8px auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><img src=\"assets/727b96dba418c27541851fc87b012208387de69ef15af2a743bb19df137d00fb.webp\" style=\"width: 80%; display: block; border-radius: 4px; margin: 8px auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/2ff09272d6fcaee630934864e4551d414e354962935996e7590ed6e8aa4ec29a.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>用于车库1楼电脑右侧玩具箱顺序</span></div></div></div><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/765ad44a3826db2088570d37440d4c9cd99a7fc3509a562841d9f25749caba79.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\">打开玩具箱，获取魔方</div></div><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/70889bf53309f4be8371d4f1adebc60ab57ee144b718d99bc5a1d3d138391a5b.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\">取下圈中的齿轮（看形状），放在列车，复制至下一循环，再乘列车带回实验室，解开容器谜题（解法见《谜题》章节内成就【开锁大师】），解开后回2楼</div></div><img src=\"assets/44e3d98cf4e25c37d1b07fa3ed6845b633f2bd8df35fe928b03f8eac4defe4e3.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><img src=\"assets/89567d71fa721f2f1006832b00728f5584d4ff05fb4bc5dc52c524d97a107448.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div></div><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/d3993d159ba3d2babd492c9fe023ebdd3351b7d44f224d01eb209e9e0f5496bd.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\">去车库1楼黄圈内按照图示步骤，拧魔方，穿越到棚屋</div></div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/c7dd1dca1b8f4798cf3ca8a4e942e19c7d7fdca1e746cbcfa5627bf06a7af322.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\">获取关卡04 RAFAEL的门禁卡，任意拧动魔方返回</div></div><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/0c67d990e92d728d19ab060950bbfe86ff83898e70f0f715cdd101c696811ca3.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\">前往RAFAEL储物柜，更新K9日历/计划系统</div></div><h1>关卡04 至少2个循环</h1></div></div><h3><b>新一循环<span>醒来，严格按照以下步骤执行（时间紧张，需要2~3分钟全部完成步骤1~6）</span></b></h3><div><span>1.出房间左拐第一个房间，前往RAFAEL的房间，打开电脑，密码MIRANDA（建议提前一循环解锁），解除安防措施；</span></div><div><div><span>2.量子电池插电；</span></div><div>3.从圆门去车库，关闭垃圾清理，拿到焚化炉钥匙；<br></div><div><span style=\"text-align: center;\">4.打开焚化炉，</span><span style=\"text-align: center\">拿到USB Key</span><br></div><div><span>5.直奔大厅电脑，使用USB Key，关闭电脑更新；</span></div><div>6.返回厨房机器人区域，电脑停止更新，<span>获取蓝图调节器</span><span>。</span></div></div><div><div data-img-block=\"\"></div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/32514789788da0661df2da53410605e9a37ee09627a76a8dd4c8b85e462158d4.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>1.出房间左拐第一个房间，前往RAFAEL的房间，打开电脑，密码MIRANDA（建议提前一循环解锁），骇入防火墙2次，</span><span>解除安防措施</span><br></div></div></div><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/323f91d7a6fc48ac9d370644c64316d74f0417b967a79b2c951688985f8fc804.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>2.量子电池插电</span><br></div></div><div><img src=\"assets/0bb2ad7d0a0217b50a44c91632dfa22cbb8b65f1c4445f5b78f7b9d3db24dcfe.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><img src=\"assets/0f4ffb916802474264e20a06e50240a17df1ebb67b3150c556e4bdf7e0cc23b9.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/577c78187412f75edf2e1d665a283c5a89454caf2af89fa18850d5586a252044.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>3.从圆门去车库，关闭垃圾清理，拿到焚化炉钥匙；</span><br></div></div><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/3bb2fdf28db2d9e050c93aa13953a6dc08c8abe0922220c8e256a11a4c103244.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\">4.打开焚化炉，<span>拿到USB Key</span></div></div><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/af8c109194156bdf96e9ed51de4f0a4120d5947a5970ad63c51269cc62a3d4be.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>5.直奔大厅电脑，使用USB Key，关闭电脑更新；</span><br></div></div><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/352e05fb075991b7ba4d92732e84c4c0171ef55af34f3f8311132fee418a4d0c.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>6.返回厨房机器人区域，电脑停止更新，</span><span>获取蓝图调节器</span><span>。</span><br></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div><h3><div>注意：游戏接近尾声，需按描述顺序在一个循环内完成：</div><div><span>从实验室前往温室，解开星座谜题，拿到JAHI房间摇把，打开JAHI房间，解开时钟齿轮谜题，恢复JAHI电脑，拿到蓝图调节器的4个电子材料清单，最后去车库用3D打印机制作调节器，制作好后，用于列车前往聚变核心，获取关卡05门禁卡，打开JONNY房间，穿越至聚变核心控制台，解锁逃生舱，通关游戏。</span></div></h3><div data-img-block=\"\"><h2><span>新一循环，坐列车（用电池）前往实验室，进入温室</span></h2></div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/5bfa7be6d52b8ccc481a7b8f6a05b045e63e238d45bab74c79aa5965724208ae.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\">按住1，打开2，查阅星座列表，截图保存，按3切换黑夜，再次按1（变蓝），抬头看星座符号及颜色，，查阅星座手册，得到3组图案</div></div><div><img src=\"assets/9e6ce7f8c3a1a4c13b4ccc8f9f1ad101e9630406f74f6d1570b2fe002163f619.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><img src=\"assets/03f2c17320b9a99a69707ae22bb635f477dc35d00c626ec5b5d259f0aa29498b.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><img src=\"assets/368fc397fb549c97d25e392cfd64b2936e36003a3a3e1355326da236ee54f7ea.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><img src=\"assets/6ddbe8c507d7fd02d33d78ab0ae1ed51e278e6c023f86eabc0569fe248716490.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/02b12ecfb29b7f5449e56909056f97f0f7a8de4070e15acc6274120a38de5cc5.webp\" style=\"width: 80%; display: block; border-radius: 4px; margin: 8px auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\">棚屋左侧输入3组符号</div></div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/9d8fa2c573fe0af707d7545cc0b7e2edc8e65207d28e1f3ab18bbd09963655bd.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>打开密码箱，拿到【把手】，前往JAHI房间</span></div></div><div><img src=\"assets/4cd58dfa83149450e8d99fec0aa33fa053ce0ac1a87d0a2a4ac8aed47adcf06b.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/4b6d4853c987c3c0badba6108b425527df97c7890e6bf91464db14791a64ddfb.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\">按顺序，从1至7找到并插入所有齿轮</div></div><div><img src=\"assets/6639d38c46ae699235e2bb78882f63590e132cf6137fd3ffe3729aa89efd6c4b.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div></div></div></div><div><img src=\"assets/249e5caf5060597d68a354b42756b0008faf0f3a9c2b5a61e0be83b5c78dd186.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><img src=\"assets/d9e7da81c3bdc70d4bd18f68cf056d18628da7141f5cc21ea0d1e420b8085c13.webp\" style=\"width: 80%; display: block; border-radius: 4px; margin: 8px auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/f4ec41eabb4c0cb52a0089ff106b84eecaa99dd92ea9c7ad06df1d5d5a6e1335.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\">依次输入<span><br></span></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>ASROOT EXTRACT DataLensArchive.qpak</span><br></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>CAT Readme.note</span></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\">BUILD DataLensInstaller.qb<br></div><div style=\"text-align: center;\">Datalens.exe train_components_list.dtl</div></div></div></div><div><img src=\"assets/ee10b0086e37a5816cb3bff0d61460de672fffcce082f3bd4a6f6173817b8198.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></div><div><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/dad969685d3db5e4aeccefdd84fa0942b117c9b20e81d44c2c26b75c2fd5ef68.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\">制作好后插入列车，修复聚变核心轨道</div></div><h1>关卡05 通关游戏</h1><h2>新一循环，前往聚变核心</h2><img src=\"assets/53a05e824b069ed85b7bcedf9aaa2a98471667ccb53331fedde863d1e26a87ae.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><img src=\"assets/f2a10f9f074867b3d80b1d185a209ba459be8007a0541390fdaff521b51dba36.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><img src=\"assets/4bee9396e7fb9faaf3083604854a318936d18de2b3672abadcd01b86d43234ea.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><img src=\"assets/093bc0ad75c7cf1e9b246fcadf93d46cefb3fd4461b93136b701947cdb27b49c.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><img src=\"assets/6b5f36f9b62e14301c450dcb042d6a6cb49a46cf9a970d7d7521ee1262d1eacc.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><img src=\"assets/c1d407b30d8e1553c975565c7e7a35e9cd055f567109161d6ff88089d7516b47.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><img src=\"assets/2e8a64ae7a51ec4eaf7fe76c18adf156931c17f712e320ab27da546a0d8c2d58.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div data-img-block=\"\"><img src=\"assets/bd0952c3e911d4f24234709400591bf1a0988fe3a6b53e0a9ddfb0042e188d77.webp\" style=\"width:80%;display:block;border-radius:4px;margin:8px auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div data-caption=\"\" style=\"text-align: center;\">25循环内通关游戏成功（容错次数在5次以内）</div></div></div><div></div></div></div></div>"
